## Resume Claims You Can Defend

Use only the result you actually measured.

### If both improve

> Modularised a Perplexity Spaces coding agent into five focused prompt files; in a controlled 16-task GitHub MCP evaluation, reduced average final-response length by **X%** while improving first-pass task completion by **Y percentage points**.

### If only completion improves

> Re-architected a Perplexity Spaces coding agent into five focused prompt files, improving first-pass completion from **A%** to **B%** in a controlled 16-task GitHub MCP evaluation.

### If only response length improves

> Modularised a Perplexity Spaces coding agent into five focused prompt files, reducing average final-response length by **X%** across a controlled 16-task GitHub MCP evaluation while maintaining **Y%** first-pass completion.

Avoid saying:

- â€œReduced total token cost by X%â€ â€” unless Perplexity provides total token/cost telemetry for both variants.
- â€œReduced bugs by X%â€ â€” unless you run a separate controlled regression test that measures actual defects after changes.
- â€œImproved performanceâ€ without naming the measured metric and test size.

